create-loaded-parent-handle-type: TPM2_CreateLoaded unmarshals parentHandle as TPMI_DH_PARENT

Classification: spec-deviation bug fix.

Specification (TPM 2.0 Part 3, TPM2_CreateLoaded, Table "TPM2_CreateLoaded
Command", Handles): "TPMI_DH_PARENT | @parentHandle | Handle of a transient
storage key, a persistent storage key, TPM_RH_ENDORSEMENT, TPM_RH_OWNER,
TPM_RH_PLATFORM+{PP}, or TPM_RH_NULL". Part 3, "Handle Area Validation":
"The TPM shall successfully unmarshal the number of handles required by the
command and validate that the value of the handle is consistent with the
command syntax. If not, the TPM shall return `TPM_RC_VALUE`."

The parentHandle of TPM2_CreateLoaded is a TPMI_DH_PARENT (Part 3,
TPM2_CreateLoaded): the hierarchies, TPM_RH_NULL and transient or
persistent objects. Version 185 unmarshals it as TPMI_DH_ENTITY+ and thus
accepts NV indices, PCRs, TPM_RH_LOCKOUT and TPM_RH_AUTH_xx, which then fail
later with other response codes (TPM_RC_HANDLE, TPM_RC_AUTH_MISSING) instead
of TPM_RC_VALUE + TPM_RC_H + TPM_RC_1 (as tpm-rs and ibmswtpm2 return). The
marshal ID TPMI_DH_PARENT, whose unmarshaling function already exists, is
added for it. Found by differential fuzzing.
diff --git a/TPMCmd/tpm/include/private/CommandDispatch.inl b/TPMCmd/tpm/include/private/CommandDispatch.inl
--- a/TPMCmd/tpm/include/private/CommandDispatch.inl
+++ b/TPMCmd/tpm/include/private/CommandDispatch.inl
@@ -2357,7 +2357,12 @@
 #define CURRENT_TPM_COMMAND CreateLoaded
 MAKE_DISPATCH_TABLE(
     // Command input handles
-    MAKE_INPUT_DISPATCH_ENTRY(MARSHAL_ID_TPMI_DH_ENTITY_Plus, parentHandle),
+    // tpm-rs differential testing -- C-ref spec deviation fix (NOT determinism):
+    // parentHandle is a TPMI_DH_PARENT (Part 3, TPM2_CreateLoaded): only the
+    // hierarchies, TPM_RH_NULL and transient/persistent objects are valid
+    // values; every other handle (NV indices, PCRs, TPM_RH_LOCKOUT,
+    // TPM_RH_AUTH_xx, ...) is TPM_RC_VALUE.
+    MAKE_INPUT_DISPATCH_ENTRY(MARSHAL_ID_TPMI_DH_PARENT, parentHandle),
 
     MAKE_DISPATCH_SEPARATOR(START_INPUT_PARAMETERS),
     // Command input parameters
diff --git a/TPMCmd/tpm/include/private/MarshalID.h b/TPMCmd/tpm/include/private/MarshalID.h
--- a/TPMCmd/tpm/include/private/MarshalID.h
+++ b/TPMCmd/tpm/include/private/MarshalID.h
@@ -67,6 +67,7 @@
     DO_MARSHAL_ID(TPMI_DH_ENTITY_Plus)       \
     DO_MARSHAL_ID(TPMI_DH_OBJECT)            \
     DO_MARSHAL_ID(TPMI_DH_OBJECT_Plus)       \
+    DO_MARSHAL_ID(TPMI_DH_PARENT)            \
     DO_MARSHAL_ID(TPMI_DH_PCR)               \
     DO_MARSHAL_ID(TPMI_DH_PCR_Plus)          \
     DO_MARSHAL_ID(TPMI_DH_PERSISTENT)        \
